  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "<p>The Australian Institute of Technical Training is located in the heart of Melbourne. Founded in 2007, AITT offers practical learning opportunities in fields such as hospitality, automotive management, and mechanics, to name but a few.</p><p>AITT's commitment to excellence in education and its welcoming atmosphere make it a popular choice for international students seeking practical skills and career-oriented training.</p> <p>Students feel well-supported thanks to the range of resources available at AITT. These include internet-based language resources, audio-visual aids, dedicated computer industry software, and labs. The student resource centre is open so students can utilise various assistance tools to support their learning, with classrooms utilising technological advancements to teach students.</p>  <p><strong>Student Life</strong></p> <p>AITT organises various events, workshops, and seminars throughout the year to ensure students have a variety of helpful and supportive learning environments to enjoy. Student clubs are another way students can enjoy a collaborative atmosphere while pursuing their hobbies and shared interests. The diverse cultural climate at the Institute is celebrated via cultural organisations and events where multiculturalism is promoted as an integrative practice.</p>"
    ]
  },
